# ai: claude-opus-5-5 | 2026-11-06
# An allowlist: everything is excluded, then only what the image runs is let back in.
# This directory also holds personal data that must never reach an image or a
# registry (credentials/, data/, uploads/, CSV exports, logs, dumps), so a new
# top-level file stays out until it is deliberately listed here.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!config.py
!wsgi.py
!gunicorn.conf.py
!backend/
!routes/
!web/
!shared/
!deploy/docker-entrypoint.sh
!frontend/

# Inside the allowed directories: build output, dependencies and caches.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
frontend/coverage
